OL,3,CTV-related anniversaries for 07 AUG
OL,4,CCHANNELS
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1985FMembers of the National Union of
OL,7,FJournalists at the BBC stage a 24-hour
OL,8,Fwalkout over a ban on the transmission
OL,9,Fof a Real Lives documentary by the BBC
OL,10,FBoard of Governors.
OL,11,
OL,12,FThe ban was regarded by the union as
OL,13,Fgovernment censorship.
OL,14,
OL,15,FNews programming on BBC TV and radio
OL,16,Fwas blacked out. Journalists at TV-am,
OL,17,FITN and some ITV regional companies
OL,18,Fjoined the strike action.
